OL,3,GNEWSAWill the Thirlwall report change
OL,4,Athe debate about Lucy Letby?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere's loud scepticism about her
OL,7,Fconvictions from some, and vocal
OL,8,Fcertainty about her guilt from others.
OL,9,FShe has become the centre of an
OL,10,Finformation war.
